/*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**                  Address Channel Architecture Diagram
**-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**
**
**   PP AR Channel   |----------|      |-----------|
**  ---------------->|    AR    |----->|  Address  | SP AR Channel
**                   |   FIFO   |      | Generator |--------------->
**                   |----------|      |-----------|
**                                          |
**                                          |  
**------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------
**            To Read Data Channel          |
**                                          V
**                                     Read Data 
**                                    control FIFO
** --------------------------------------------------------------------
*/
